     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syntax map of verb position",
     "texto": [
      "**Position 2**: normal sentences and the connectors **deshalb**, **trotzdem**, **dann**, **danach**.",
      "**Position 1**: yes/no questions (**Kommst du?**) and the imperative (**Sei pünktlich!**).",
      "**Verb at the end**: subordinate clauses (**weil, dass, wenn, als, obwohl, damit**) and relative clauses (**der, die, das, den**)."
     ],
